  "description": "OLE-PROP: for the ACCDB and the MDB fixture, on a Connection with Provider = ACE read the full Properties inventory (Name, Type, Value, Attributes); set Data Source and Mode = adModeRead and read State, Mode, Attributes, IsolationLevel and timeouts; Open and read the inventory again; Close and read it a third time. Asks which initialization, data-source-information and session properties exist and how each differs between ACCDB and MDB and between states.",
